  Time identifier:          day
  Level-2 identifier:       person
  Sample Size:              2713
  Level-2 Clusters:         131
  Missing Data Info:

                      Pattern #:       1     2     3     4
                          miss % --------------------------
                     pain =  1.3       -     -     M     M  
                    sleep =  1.3       -     -     M     M  
                pain.lag1 =  6.1       -     M     -     M  
               sleep.lag1 =  6.1       -     M     -     M  
                                 --------------------------
                                 %  93.2   5.5   0.7   0.6


MODEL INFORMATION:

  NUMBER OF PARAMETERS
    Outcome Models:         31
    Predictor Models:       0

  FACTORS
    Level-2:                b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j g_2j

  DEFINED VARIABLES
    [1]  sleep_lag = sleep.lag - b_0j 
    [2]  pain_lag = pain.lag - g_0j 

  MODELS

   between:
    [1]  b_0j ~ Intercept@b_0
    [2]  b_1j ~ Intercept@b_1
    [3]  b_2j ~ Intercept@b_2
    [4]  g_0j ~ Intercept@g_0
    [5]  g_1j ~ Intercept@g_1
    [6]  g_2j ~ Intercept@g_2
    [7]  b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j g_2j <-> b_0j b_1j b_2j g_0j g_1j g_2j 

   within:
    [8]  pain ~ g_0j@1 (pain_lag)*g_1j@1 (sleep_lag)*g_2j@1
    [9]  sleep ~ b_0j@1 (sleep_lag)*b_1j@1 (pain_lag)*b_2j@1 (sleep_lag*pain_lag)@b_3
   [10]  pain <-> sleep


